          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 3: Documentation, Hygiene, and Release Readiness",
      "cycles": [
        {
          "name": "Cycle 1: Documentation Alignment",
          "objectives": [
            "Ensure documentation reflects both formal architecture and jailbreak-discovered logic paths",
            "Enhance clarity, onboarding readiness, and systemic transparency",
            "Update and synchronize all artifacts"
